.TH man 1 "2026-10-15" "0.19.0" "Profanity XMPP client"

.SH NAME
/mucping

.SH DESCRIPTION
Set the interval and timeout for MUC self-pings (XEP-0410). Recommended interval is between 300 and 900 seconds, with a timeout of 10 to 60 seconds. Note that the interval must be greater than the timeout.

.SH SYNOPSIS
/mucping set <seconds>

.LP
/mucping timeout <seconds>

.LP

.SH ARGUMENTS
.PP
\fBset <seconds>\fR
.RS 4
Number of seconds of idle room activity before sending a ping, a value of 0 disables MUC self-pings.
.RE
.PP
\fBtimeout <seconds>\fR
.RS 4
Seconds to wait for MUC self-ping responses, after which the room connection is considered disconnected. A value of 0 disables MUC self-pings entirely.
.RE
